  "findings": [
    "ModData.create refuses occupied names; cacheFileExists paths are relative to cache/Lua. Writer has no exclusive-create guarantee; single coordinator and preserved receipts required.",
    "OnClientCommand resolves player from sender connection. Capability.AnimalCheats authenticates the admin on server; client arguments never supply identity, breed or position.",
    "SP uses explicit local authority and OnGameStart; sendServerCommand does nothing in SP, so local callback is separate.",
    "Native type loads shared Lua before lazy definition cache; adult stage has no replacement; original code deep-copies vanilla raccoon references, avatar and parts at runtime.",
    "ObjectModDataPacket accepts animal ModData load/wipe. Marker matches are diagnostics, not trusted multiplayer provenance. Dedicated NativeSession.prepareOwnership is blocked.",
    "Pickup/pet flags affect normal menus; trailer/feed paths can ignore flags. Native raccoon interactions remain; transport/growth/corpse continuity is not approved.",
    "Constructor can register an instance before caller addToWorld. Receipt and both roots precede constructor; errors never trigger automatic respawn."
  ]
